{"nodes": [{"id": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_du6_exchangeability", "label": "72 \u2014 the exchangeability violation behind the Beer Hall under-coverage", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_exchangeability_diagnostic", "label": "eval/exchangeability_diagnostic.py", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_expanding_calibration_pool", "label": "The expanding calibration pool", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "interval_calibration.run_online admits every residual whose target date the origin has observed, so the quantile at any origin is estimated over the venue's entire past \u2014 too narrow for a present whose errors have grown and too wide for one whose errors have shrunk."}, {"id": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_one_mechanism_three_signs", "label": "One mechanism, three venues, three signs", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The estate supplies its own control: a drift account must predict rising scale at the Beer Hall, falling at Two River Taps and something flat-tailed at Ellel. Any other outcome refutes it. That is what makes this an identification rather than a story fitted to one venue."}, {"id": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_rank_uniformity", "label": "Rank uniformity of the conformity scores", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Under exchangeability the within-group rank is Uniform(0,1) by construction; the implied coverage reproduces the published coverage at all three venues to within a thousandth, which is the check that the diagnostic measures the same object the coverage table measures."}, {"id": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_survives_deflections", "label": "It survives the closure-group, horizon and point-forecaster deflections", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The effect is present inside the active trading group and at every one of the seven horizon steps, and the served exogenous model under-covers at 0.870 against the illustrative model's 0.871."}, {"id": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_claim_boundary_form_not_cause", "label": "The claim is about the form of the violation, not its cause", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Growth in trade is the obvious candidate and is not tested; the diagnostic does not separate it from several other things. It also does not license inflating the nominal level, because a constant inflation calibrated on today's drift is a fixed correction to a moving target."}, {"id": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_barber_conformal_2023", "label": "barber_conformal_2023 \u2014 conformal beyond exchangeability", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_d_u6", "label": "D-U6 \u2014 the last UNRESOLVED row not blocked on a third party", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_du6_exchangeability", "target": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_exchangeability_diagnostic", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_du6_exchangeability", "target": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_expanding_calibration_pool", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_expanding_calibration_pool", "target": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_one_mechanism_three_signs", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_du6_exchangeability", "target": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_rank_uniformity", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_rank_uniformity", "target": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_one_mechanism_three_signs", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/72_DU6_exchangeability_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.